  "all_new_sources_on_terminal_import_chain": true,
  "scope": "On the constructed common positive annulus for every compact real parameter set, source-dependent mu/theta derivatives are actual Banach-jet and pointwise derivatives, uniquely solve their classical linearized boundary equations including radial second derivatives at endpoints, and satisfy uniform tangent and coupled residual-error estimates. The manuscript prescribed matching annulus and actual nonlinear Hartree source/overlap remain open."
